        "query": "WITH claimed AS (\n  INSERT INTO ola_replay_staging.used_tokens (token_digest)\n  VALUES ($1::text)\n  ON CONFLICT (token_digest) DO NOTHING\n  RETURNING 1\n)\nSELECT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM claimed) AS claimed;",
